@startuml
!define DPI 300
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #E1F5FE
    BorderColor #01579B
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam partition {
    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    BorderColor #4A148C
    FontSize 12
    FontStyle bold
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #F57F17
}
skinparam padding 20
skinparam minClassWidth 0
skinparam minClassHeight 0
skinparam shadowing false
title High-Level Integration Process\n(RS-DRL with Self-Adaptive System)

start

:Stage 1: Sense data from Managed System;
note right
  (1) Sensor data collected
  from managed system
end note

:Stage 2: Forward data to RS-DRL module;
note right
  (2) Monitor forwards runtime data
  to RS-DRL module
end note

:Stage 3: Update trained model in Knowledge;
note right
  (3) Trained DRL model updated
  in Knowledge repository
end note

:Stage 4: Forward sensor data to Analyzer;
note right
  (4) Sensor data processed
  by Analyzer
end note

:Stage 5: Analyzer detects violations and notifies Predictor;
note right
  (5) Analyzer notifies
  Adaptation Option Predictor
end note

:Stage 6: Retrieve trained model for prediction;
note right
  (6) Trained model retrieved
  for adaptation prediction
end note

:Stage 7: Predict adaptation option;
note right
  (7) Best adaptation option
  predicted by Planner
end note

:Stage 8: Retrieve adaptation option details;
note right
  (8) Adaptation details retrieved
  from Knowledge
end note

:Stage 9: Execute adaptation on Managed System;
note right
  (9) Adaptation applied
  to managed system
end note

:Stage 1: Sense data from Managed System;
note right
  Loop back to continuous
  monitoring and adaptation
end note

stop

@enduml
